But if Frodo hadn't destroyed the ring, then goodness itself might have died.
但如果弗罗多没有摧毁戒指，那么善良本身可能就会消亡。

1430
00:58:28.400 --> 00:58:29.880
I didn't understand that.
我没听懂那个。

1431
